        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Drop the First Few\n\nSkips a fixed number of items at the front of a stream. Use it to discard header rows from a feed or warm-up items you do not want to process.\n\n**How it works:** \"Items\" holds five Greek letter names. \"Fan out\" emits them one at a time into \"Drop 2\", which discards the first two and passes the rest. \"Rest\" collects gamma, delta and epsilon. It runs locally with no model or key.\n\n**Try this:** Change n on \"Drop 2\" from 2 to 4 and check that only epsilon reaches \"Rest\"."
        },
